### `fontWeight`

Specifies font weight. The values `'normal'` and `'bold'` are supported for most fonts. Not all fonts have a variant for each of the numeric values, in that case the closest one is chosen.

| Type                                                                                                                  | Default    |
| --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------- |
